@startuml
title Sequo API - System Context

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Customer
actor Merchant
actor "Merchant Staff" as MerchantStaff
actor Courier
actor "Relay Partner" as RelayPartner
actor "Support/Admin" as Admin

rectangle "Client Applications" as Clients {
  [Customer App] as CustomerApp
  [Merchant App] as MerchantApp
  [Courier App] as CourierApp
  [Relay App] as RelayApp
  [Admin Web] as AdminWeb
}

rectangle "Sequo API\nSpring Boot / Kotlin" as Api {
  [Auth and RBAC]
  [Catalog]
  [Cart and Order Workflow]
  [Pricing Engine]
  [Commission Engine]
  [Bargaining]
  [Cooperative Markets]
  [Delivery and Relay Logistics]
  [Returns and Settlements]
  [Wallet Payments]
  [Notifications and Realtime]
  [Audit and Reporting]
}

database "PostgreSQL" as Db
cloud "Object Storage\nimages, KYC, proof, evidence" as Storage
cloud "Yas Togo Wallet" as Yas
cloud "Moov Africa Wallet" as Moov
cloud "Firebase Cloud Messaging" as FCM
cloud "SMS / WhatsApp Providers" as Notify
queue "STOMP Broker Relay\nwhen horizontally scaled" as StompBroker
cloud "Observability Stack" as Obs

Customer --> CustomerApp
Merchant --> MerchantApp
MerchantStaff --> MerchantApp
Courier --> CourierApp
RelayPartner --> RelayApp
Admin --> AdminWeb

Clients --> Api : HTTPS + JWT\n/api/v1
Clients --> Api : WebSocket/STOMP + JWT\n/ws

Api --> Db : transactions,\nqueries, ledgers
Api --> Storage : upload/read artifacts
Api --> Yas : payment, refund,\npayout integration
Api --> Moov : payment, refund,\npayout integration
Api --> FCM : mobile push
Api --> Notify : SMS / WhatsApp fallback
Api --> StompBroker : realtime broker relay
Api --> Obs : logs, metrics,\ntraces, alerts

note right of Api
Financial truth, order state, role enforcement,
and audit history live on the backend.
end note

@enduml
